<title>NETHERLANDS: HOEK LOOS 1996 ORDINARY NET UP 13 PCT.</title>
<headline>HOEK LOOS 1996 ORDINARY NET UP 13 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops    57.5  vs  49.0</p>
<p>    Net after extraordinary gains   57.5  vs  67.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.10 vs   2.75</p>
<p>    Turnover			     565.3  vs 548.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    90.3  vs  81.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial gasses producer NV WA Hoek's Machine- en</p>
<p>Zuurstoffabriek (Hoek Loos) said the 1996 dividend could be</p>
<p>taken up in cash or as an optional payment in new shares.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
